hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"20334","Bahz narrated to us, Ikrimah ibn Ammar narrated to us, al-Hirmas ibn Ziyad al-Bahili narrated to us, he said: I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) with my father mounting me behind him on a donkey, and I was small, and I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) preaching at Mina upon his she-camel al-Adba."
"20335","Abd al-Samad narrated to us, Ikrimah ibn Ammar narrated to us, al-Hirmas ibn Ziyad al-Bahili narrated to us, he said: My father mounted me behind him, and I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) preaching to the people on the day of sacrifice at Mina upon his she-camel al-Adba."
